{"seq":1,"slug":"stateful-testing","title":"状态机测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/stateful-testing","wordCount":1299,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态机测试\">状态机测试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>状态机测试将属性测试扩展到有状态系统：自动生成操作序列，在每步操作后验证系统状态与参考模型一致。核心组件为规则（可执行的操作）、前置条件（操作的合法性约束）、不变量（每步之后必须成立的条件）和参考模型（简化的已知正确实现）。收缩器将数十步的反例序列最小化为 2-3 步的最简重现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有状态系统的测试挑战\">有状态系统的测试挑战</h2><p>大多数真实系统是有状态的——数据库、API 服务、并发数据结构、UI 组件。这些系统的行为不仅取决于当前输入，还取决于之前操作积累的<em>状态</em>。传统的无状态属性测试（对单个函数调用验证不变量）无法捕获状态交互中的 bug——例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连续执行特定操作序列后出现数据不一致</li>\n<li>并发操作导致的竞态条件</li>\n<li>状态转换中的遗漏路径</li>\n<li>资源泄漏（连接、文件句柄在特定序列后未释放）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>状态机测试（Stateful Testing / Model-Based Testing）是属性测试在有状态系统上的扩展：它自动生成<em>操作序列</em>，在每步操作后验证系统状态是否与预期模型一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于规则的状态机测试模型\">基于规则的状态机测试模型</h2><p>Hypothesis 的 <code>RuleBasedStateMachine</code> 是状态机测试的标准实现。其核心思想是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>定义系统的可能<strong>操作</strong>（rules）</li>\n<li>定义每个操作的<strong>前置条件</strong>（preconditions）</li>\n<li>定义操作后的<strong>不变量检查</strong>（invariants）</li>\n<li>框架自动生成操作序列并验证不变量始终成立</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from hypothesis.stateful import RuleBasedStateMachine, rule, precondition, invariant&#10;from hypothesis import strategies as st&#10;&#10;class DatabaseStateMachine(RuleBasedStateMachine):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.db = Database()&#10;        self.model = {}  # 参考模型（字典）&#10;&#10;    @rule(key=st.text(min_size=1), value=st.binary())&#10;    def put(self, key, value):&#10;        self.db.put(key, value)&#10;        self.model[key] = value&#10;&#10;    @rule(key=st.text(min_size=1))&#10;    def get(self, key):&#10;        db_result = self.db.get(key)&#10;        model_result = self.model.get(key)&#10;        assert db_result == model_result&#10;&#10;    @rule(key=st.text(min_size=1))&#10;    @precondition(lambda self: len(self.model) &gt; 0)&#10;    def delete(self, key):&#10;        if key in self.model:&#10;            self.db.delete(key)&#10;            del self.model[key]&#10;&#10;    @invariant()&#10;    def size_consistent(self):&#10;        assert self.db.size() == len(self.model)&#10;&#10;TestDatabase = DatabaseStateMachine.TestCase\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hypothesis.stateful </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RuleBasedStateMachine, rule, precondition, invariant</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hypothesis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strategies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> st</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DatabaseStateMachine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RuleBasedStateMachine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.db </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 参考模型（字典）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.text(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.binary())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key, value):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.db.put(key, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.text(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        db_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.db.get(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        model_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.get(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.text(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @precondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> self: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.db.delete(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            del</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model[key]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @invariant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> size_consistent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.db.size() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TestDatabase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DatabaseStateMachine.TestCase</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[初始化状态机] --&gt; B[选择满足前置条件的规则]&#10;    B --&gt; C[生成规则参数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[执行操作]&#10;    D --&gt; E[检查不变量]&#10;    E --&gt; F{不变量成立?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G{达到步数上限?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| B&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[测试通过]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| I[收缩操作序列]&#10;    I --&gt; J[报告最小反例序列]\">flowchart TD\n    A[初始化状态机] --&gt; B[选择满足前置条件的规则]\n    B --&gt; C[生成规则参数]\n    C --&gt; D[执行操作]\n    D --&gt; E[检查不变量]\n    E --&gt; F{不变量成立?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G{达到步数上限?}\n    G --&gt;|否| B\n    G --&gt;|是| H[测试通过]\n    F --&gt;|否| I[收缩操作序列]\n    I --&gt; J[报告最小反例序列]</pre><h2 id=\"参考模型的设计\">参考模型的设计</h2><p>状态机测试的核心是<strong>参考模型</strong>（Reference Model / Oracle Model）——一个简化的、已知正确的系统表示。测试策略是：对同一操作序列，系统和模型的响应必须一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统类型</th>\n<th>参考模型</th>\n<th>验证策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>键值存储</td>\n<td>Python dict</td>\n<td>get 返回值一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级队列</td>\n<td>排序列表</td>\n<td>pop 返回最小值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>无限容量 dict + LRU 逻辑</td>\n<td>命中/淘汰行为一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态机</td>\n<td>枚举型状态 + 转换表</td>\n<td>状态转换合法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发集合</td>\n<td>单线程等价实现</td>\n<td>线性化验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>参考模型的设计原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>尽可能简单</strong>——模型本身不应成为 bug 来源。用最直接的数据结构（dict、list）</li>\n<li><strong>只建模被验证的行为</strong>——不需要模拟性能特征</li>\n<li><strong>允许宽松比较</strong>——某些系统行为的确是不确定的（如遍历顺序），模型应接受合法的非确定性</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"并发系统的线性化测试\">并发系统的线性化测试</h2><p>对并发数据结构，最强的正确性保证是<strong>线性化</strong>（Linearizability）：并发执行的操作序列必须等价于某个串行执行序列。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ConcurrentQueueTest(RuleBasedStateMachine):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.queue = ConcurrentQueue()&#10;        self.expected = []  # 线性化参考&#10;        self.threads = []&#10;&#10;    @rule(value=st.integers())&#10;    def enqueue(self, value):&#10;        self.queue.enqueue(value)&#10;        self.expected.append(value)&#10;&#10;    @rule()&#10;    @precondition(lambda self: len(self.expected) &gt; 0)&#10;    def dequeue(self):&#10;        result = self.queue.dequeue()&#10;        # 线性化检查：结果必须是 expected 中的某个值&#10;        assert result in self.expected&#10;        self.expected.remove(result)&#10;&#10;    @invariant()&#10;    def no_duplicates_lost(self):&#10;        # 队列中的元素数 + 已取出的元素数 = 总插入数&#10;        assert self.queue.size() == len(self.expected)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConcurrentQueueTest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RuleBasedStateMachine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ConcurrentQueue()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 线性化参考</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.integers())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> enqueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, value):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue.enqueue(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected.append(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @precondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> self: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dequeue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue.dequeue()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 线性化检查：结果必须是 expected 中的某个值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected.remove(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @invariant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> no_duplicates_lost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 队列中的元素数 + 已取出的元素数 = 总插入数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queue.size() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expected)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于更复杂的并发场景（多生产者多消费者），可以使用 Jepsen 风格的线性化检查器（如 <code>porcupine</code> for Go、<code>linearizability-checker</code> for Java）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api-接口的状态机测试\">API 接口的状态机测试</h2><p>RESTful API 是状态机测试的理想目标——API 的状态由服务端数据定义，操作是 HTTP 请求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class RestApiStateMachine(RuleBasedStateMachine):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.client = TestClient(app)&#10;        self.created_ids = []&#10;&#10;    @rule(data=st.fixed_dictionaries({&#10;        &#39;name&#39;: st.text(min_size=1, max_size=100),&#10;        &#39;email&#39;: st.emails()&#10;    }))&#10;    def create_user(self, data):&#10;        response = self.client.post(&#39;/users&#39;, json=data)&#10;        assert response.status_code == 201&#10;        user_id = response.json()[&#39;id&#39;]&#10;        self.created_ids.append(user_id)&#10;&#10;    @rule()&#10;    @precondition(lambda self: len(self.created_ids) &gt; 0)&#10;    def get_user(self):&#10;        user_id = self.created_ids[-1]&#10;        response = self.client.get(f&#39;/users/{user_id}&#39;)&#10;        assert response.status_code == 200&#10;        assert response.json()[&#39;id&#39;] == user_id&#10;&#10;    @rule()&#10;    @precondition(lambda self: len(self.created_ids) &gt; 0)&#10;    def delete_user(self):&#10;        user_id = self.created_ids.pop()&#10;        response = self.client.delete(f&#39;/users/{user_id}&#39;)&#10;        assert response.status_code == 204&#10;        # 验证删除后获取返回 404&#10;        response = self.client.get(f&#39;/users/{user_id}&#39;)&#10;        assert response.status_code == 404&#10;&#10;    @invariant()&#10;    def list_consistent(self):&#10;        response = self.client.get(&#39;/users&#39;)&#10;        listed_ids = [u[&#39;id&#39;] for u in response.json()]&#10;        for uid in self.created_ids:&#10;            assert uid in listed_ids\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RestApiStateMachine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RuleBasedStateMachine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TestClient(app)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.created_ids </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.fixed_dictionaries({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: st.text(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'email'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: st.emails()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client.post(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.status_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 201</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.json()[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.created_ids.append(user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @precondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> self: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.created_ids) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.created_ids[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client.get(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.status_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.json()[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @precondition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> self: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.created_ids) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> delete_user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.created_ids.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client.delete(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.status_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 204</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 验证删除后获取返回 404</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client.get(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.status_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 404</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @invariant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> list_consistent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.client.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        listed_ids </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [u[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.json()]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.created_ids:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listed_ids</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"收缩操作序列\">收缩操作序列</h2><p>状态机测试发现的反例是一个<em>操作序列</em>——可能包含数十个步骤。收缩器需要找到触发 bug 的最小步骤序列：</p>\n<p>原始反例（20 步）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"create_user(name=&quot;a&quot;) → get_user() → create_user(name=&quot;b&quot;) →&#10;delete_user() → create_user(name=&quot;c&quot;) → ... → get_user() → FAIL\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>create_user(name=\"a\") → get_user() → create_user(name=\"b\") →</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>delete_user() → create_user(name=\"c\") → ... → get_user() → FAIL</span></span></code></pre></div><p>收缩后（3 步）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"create_user(name=&quot;x&quot;) → delete_user() → get_user() → FAIL\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>create_user(name=\"x\") → delete_user() → get_user() → FAIL</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Hypothesis 的序列收缩策略包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>删除不影响失败的步骤</li>\n<li>缩短步骤参数（更短的字符串、更小的数字）</li>\n<li>重排独立步骤以找到更简单的排列</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"状态机测试的工程模式\">状态机测试的工程模式</h2><p><strong>模式 1：影子模型（Shadow Model）</strong></p>\n<p>对每个操作同时更新真实系统和简化模型，断言两者一致。适用于可以用简单数据结构建模的系统。</p>\n<p><strong>模式 2：不变量检查</strong></p>\n<p>不维护完整模型，只在每步操作后验证关键不变量。适用于模型构建成本高或系统行为难以精确建模的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@invariant()&#10;def balance_non_negative(self):&#10;    assert self.account.balance &gt;= 0&#10;&#10;@invariant()&#10;def total_supply_constant(self):&#10;    assert sum(a.balance for a in self.all_accounts) == INITIAL_SUPPLY\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@invariant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> balance_non_negative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.account.balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@invariant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> total_supply_constant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a.balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.all_accounts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> INITIAL_SUPPLY</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模式 3：回归捕获</strong></p>\n<p>不定义任何属性，只检测系统是否崩溃/panic/返回错误。这是最弱但最容易实施的模式，适合遗留系统：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@rule(op=st.sampled_from([&#39;read&#39;, &#39;write&#39;, &#39;delete&#39;, &#39;compact&#39;]))&#10;def any_operation(self, op):&#10;    # 执行操作，只要不崩溃就算通过&#10;    getattr(self.system, op)()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">op</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">st.sampled_from([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'read'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'write'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'compact'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> any_operation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, op):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 执行操作，只要不崩溃就算通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    getattr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.system, op)()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>状态机测试是属性测试在有状态系统上的自然延伸——通过自动生成操作序列和收缩反例序列，发现状态交互中的深层 bug。参考模型（影子模型）是最强大的模式，以简单数据结构模拟系统预期行为；不变量检查模式在模型构建困难时提供轻量替代。并发系统可通过线性化检查验证正确性。API 的状态机测试直接模拟用户行为序列——创建、读取、更新、删除的交错组合。序列收缩将数十步的复杂反例精简为最小可重现步骤。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: 状态机测试在本地开发中发现深层 bug；要让属性测试和模糊测试持续保护代码库，需要将它们集成到 CI/CD 管道。见 <a href=\"integration-ci\">CI 集成策略</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"状态机测试","id":"状态机测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"有状态系统的测试挑战","id":"有状态系统的测试挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"基于规则的状态机测试模型","id":"基于规则的状态机测试模型"},{"level":2,"text":"参考模型的设计","id":"参考模型的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"并发系统的线性化测试","id":"并发系统的线性化测试"},{"level":2,"text":"API 接口的状态机测试","id":"api-接口的状态机测试"},{"level":2,"text":"收缩操作序列","id":"收缩操作序列"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机测试的工程模式","id":"状态机测试的工程模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"变异测试指标与改进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-metrics"},"next":{"title":"CI 集成与持续模糊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/practice/integration-ci"}}